    "dialogTextSample": "HOW TO PLAY\nABYSS LINE\n×\n\nTHE DIVE\n\nThe sub lights a board of gold ducats. Plot your CLAIM LINE by tapping 8 to 60 ducats · they need not connect, pick freely. Then RUN THE LINE to commit. On reveal, every safe ducat loads gold into the HAUL, but a cracked ducat (a sea-mine) busts the whole run. Prove the full line and it cashes out.\n\nDIVE DEPTH · DEPTH FLOORS\n\nREEF SHELF\n6 mines · up to 8.95x\nMID",
